ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Rule of 24^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^b2.    not included by Kia  (the Movie Maker)^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Do not bid slam missing 2 key cards and the Queen^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  A very difficult hand to play^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  With a weak hand and 5-4 in the majors, you should always transfer and not bid Stayman^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  Advantages of Bergen Raises ^*N|

