UP|52|nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BNorth:^*n Was there any point in my raising to 4@D using |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at|?|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 19 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|You could. However a) given a 3rd seat preempt there is some chance I only have 6 diamonds with good distribution because as I said preempts in 3rd seat are much more far ranging.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|And b) since East already passed, it is unlikely she would come in. Plus although even if you knew I had 7 diamonds and LOTT does apply, the fact that you have a flat weak hand makes it more likely that we will go down. Not here though, even if you raised to 4, it does make.|
PG| ***** 21 ***** |


